                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The dataset consists of two data files (.csv) and an R Markdown script file (.Rmd). The code in the script file is divided in four major blocks:\r\n<ol>\r\n<li> Loading data: the required packages, functions and datasets are loaded</li>\r\n<li>Distributions: a goodness of fit test and information for zero inflation</li>\r\n<li>Statistical analyses: here all the GLMM are provided</li>\r\n<li>Creating figures: all figures shown in the manuscript</li>\r\n</ol>"
